   "item_id": 269251,
   "item_text": "Click for solution",
   "item_forum_id": 0,
   "item_type": "post_hidden",
   "in_feed": null,
   "is_watched": null,
   "item_score": "990",
   "id": "27500",
   "item_level": "990",
   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 269251,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 42566,
    "poster_id": 5412,
    "post_rendered": "For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a221e63d8d6d0f52aade166cedd32f36f98a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|y|&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" > the solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" > are <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4edc27c2ab2789d9e2727d1c47d02ce74c6afb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-1),(0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\nLet's assume <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" >,</span> the equation is equivalent to <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4d3e0f4e9f176370d1daa73c381bcdea826359f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+1)(y-1)=2x^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"19\" >.</span> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/6/e463011a45d95f70fb7c1580cd1ef00579bfda97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+1,y-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" > are coprime for odd divisors, then there exist such odd, coprime numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f03710a9ffbf0ecba4ae631d6f3bd28ff7f48f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u,v$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" > that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78af390216ca34f7479586e005474273df9ca419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2^tuv$\"  width=\"69\" height=\"15\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21fbac2fab07f68a793a746a7b11affc45ac4f49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-1=2^mu^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" > , <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b77d18f42a1028efaeae1245d5d84e2ede08918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+1=2^nv^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" >,</span> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46ba6ed097cc88ded349bf99eea89817f135f470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"11\" > are postive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\"  width=\"6\" height=\"11\" > is a non-negative positive integer.<br>\nLet's note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5dec37869ba16d55d61dbf5bea9b6d069b45ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = 4t+1= 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"13\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\nSo we have <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b676308462657de5137ec8d3b4be90f31a34a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^nv^4-2^mu^4=2$\"  width=\"129\" height=\"15\" >,</span> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f7f42d0c1bdb6d30ffe6697ca0c03ebdcfabf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$min\\{m,n\\}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" > and <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/1/11135653d9d2533be5b0bf446a8314fa041f98ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$max\\{m,n\\}&gt;min\\{m,n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" >:</span><br>\n1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b5800f5ad040d308609190ef18a9e0ca08a9b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" > thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f726944b5fc8ccfbb1e337ae458bfda22f43a319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{n-1}v^4-u^4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/65262bf247c4a3c6114a8223d249dc9702619d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" >)</span>, but because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7b899c1708f33f14f6a7c5f4fa0f09fac1d5d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" > so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7311071b27ad70454d7d8fd4e1858defe83c9440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" >,</span>so <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/e/49e6a2d706867d6652d7edadccc3fd034130bd98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" >.</span> However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/884a627dd540288e7675663689996b9644c52be3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^4+1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" >,</span> so we have a contradiction because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba78e70e4f45e30808cc2411039f3b501f933c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8|2^{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"19\" > so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4a55f80d14908a3d348fba462c0eefeb9fa6a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{n-1}=0$\"  width=\"68\" height=\"15\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\n2<span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">)<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" ></span> thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/3/ac33f77d35f9bfd4921f1237afba6e2f6f8f66f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v^4-2^{m-1}u^4=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/65262bf247c4a3c6114a8223d249dc9702619d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" >)</span>, so <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1fc83267ef00ee04f7e45b01fbd43d2d5c1ae77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(v^2-1)(v^2+1)=2^{m-1}u^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"19\" >.</span> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/105177f8868a6ef37496da7a114faf0e4b561018.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v^2+1,v^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" > <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/873d341ef57653e8e19171182a320c00c53b59f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" >)</span> are coprime for odd divisors, then there exist such odd, coprime numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" > that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/65318c02b415b7777e6e1cd72a024e086ed4373a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=ab$\"  width=\"52\" height=\"12\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bda07067d15ea4c57375083fc4b182e1fc495e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v^2-1=2^{m-2}a^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" > , <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/4610dba29156cc2ee5a7c6254514ca89d4da0676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v^2+1=2b^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" >.</span> Thus<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd98d9a64c26a401664c1dcc66352f4000ba9b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(v+2^{\\frac{m-2}{2}}a^2)(v-2^{\\frac{m-2}{2}}a^2)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"23\" > ( because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb3c3fc06952a2100f52121a8c5b403e14e575f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65c634590199e8687d7f4ab5d72a2d5a2a5fc14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mod 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f555deaf69c02efa1021189cc6d4c05db35886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-2$\"  width=\"46\" height=\"12\" > is even), but that is impossible.<br>\n1) and 2) haven't given any solutions, so there aren't any solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > and also for <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cde0181c92809d2f2eb7bdae7c46e2d0ea277044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" >-</span> the equality is symmetric, so the only solutions are: <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e82c0075adc02f0707238ba04ce8ee59f2c7732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,1),(0,-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" >.</span>",
    "post_canonical": "For $|y|<2$ the solutions $(x,y)$ are $(0,-1),(0,1)$.\r\nLet's assume $y>1$, the equation is equivalent to $(y+1)(y-1)=2x^4$. Because $y+1,y-1$ are coprime for odd divisors, then there exist such odd, coprime numbers $u,v$ that $x=2^tuv$ and $y-1=2^mu^4$ , $y+1=2^nv^4$, where $m,n$ are postive integers and $t$ is a non-negative positive integer.\r\nLet's note that $m+n = 4t+1= 1$ $(\\mod 4)$.\r\nSo we have $2^nv^4-2^mu^4=2$, so $min\\{m,n\\}=1$ and $max\\{m,n\\}>min\\{m,n\\}$:\r\n1) $m=1$ thus $2^{n-1}v^4-u^4=1$ ($n>1$), but because $m+n = 1$ $(\\mod 4)$ so $n-1=3$ $(\\mod 4)$,so $n \\geq 3$. However, $u^4+1=2$ $(\\mod 4)$, so we have a contradiction because $8|2^{n-1}$ so $2^{n-1}=0$ $(\\mod 4)$.\r\n2)$n=1$ thus $v^4-2^{m-1}u^4=1$ ($n>1$), so $(v^2-1)(v^2+1)=2^{m-1}u^4$. Because $v^2+1,v^2-1$ ($v>1$) are coprime for odd divisors, then there exist such odd, coprime numbers $a,b$ that $u=ab$ and $v^2-1=2^{m-2}a^4$ , $v^2+1=2b^4$. Thus\r\n$(v+2^{\\frac{m-2}{2}}a^2)(v-2^{\\frac{m-2}{2}}a^2)=1$ ( because $m+n=1$ $(\\mod 4)$ and $n=1$ then $m-2$ is even), but that is impossible.\r\n1) and 2) haven't given any solutions, so there aren't any solutions for $y>1$ and also for $y<-1$- the equality is symmetric, so the only solutions are: $(0,1),(0,-1)$.",
